      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f8b711058afa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Worried about the cost? You’re not alone! Here are some avenues to explore:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e38508a8a23e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1eef28334132",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Scholarships:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b8ac57202802",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Numerous scholarships are available specifically for international students. Explore options offered by governments, universities, and private organizations."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "85853dade146",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b2443c20b8f5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Affordable Programs:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6ec0d456401e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Many countries offer high-quality education at a lower cost than traditional destinations. Consider Germany’s public universities with low or no tuition fees or programs in Spain and other European countries."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "40442b66ea89",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fc82bac53d8e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Financial Aid:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "52753f4ea7d4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Check if your home university offers financial aid packages that can be applied to study abroad programs."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
